      "updated": 1789750774783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"Breakthroughs\" folder (2–5 min clips)\n\n\"Stuck moments\"\n\n\"Cool tricks I used\"\nuse this format YYYY_MM_DD__TOPIC__TYPE.webm\nso store makes subfolders:\nBreakthroughs\nExplanations (recapping on important stuff)\nLong Sessions(Excercises)\nStuck Sessions(Hard Excercises that i know im going to  be stuck on) ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"Breakthroughs\" folder (2–5 min clips)\n\n\"Stuck moments\"\n\n\"Cool tricks I used\"\nuse this format YYYY_MM_DD__TOPIC__TYPE.webm\nso store makes subfolders:\nBreakthroughs\nExplanations (recapping on important stuff)\nLong Sessions(Excercises)\nStuck Sessions(Hard Excercises that i know im going to  be stuck on) ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dLcmpQeiIx73QGNp_PFQG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4063.503125200371,
      "y": -3093.6710936035756,
      "width": 825.7392578125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1374912128,
      "version": 387,
      "versionNonce": 1818747793,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789750774783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "because we know that DO and BO are the same hence two interior segments add up\nto big ones so DB = DO + BO; hence these two can be interchanged by x so\nDB = 2x; < -- this is only possible if the two segments are the midponts seperated\ncongruent parts;",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "because we know that DO and BO are the same hence two interior segments add up\nto big ones so DB = DO + BO; hence these two can be interchanged by x so\nDB = 2x; < -- this is only possible if the two segments are the midponts seperated\ncongruent parts;",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
