    {
      "id": "URf14Lwc_R8I0pGZhwDet",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2599.417838742037,
      "y": -3254.418435183437,
      "width": 613.6194458007812,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1694771584,
      "version": 635,
      "versionNonce": 138686993,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789750774783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-If two congruent interior segment make up the exteriod \nsegment then the shared endpoint between them is the \nmidpoint of the exterior segment!\n\n\n-two shapes are said to be congruent such that the pair \nof vertices of 1 shape is translated on to another and that \nthey form the exact same angles and have the same segments;\nso parts of ~== shapes ~==",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-If two congruent interior segment make up the exteriod \nsegment then the shared endpoint between them is the \nmidpoint of the exterior segment!\n\n\n-two shapes are said to be congruent such that the pair \nof vertices of 1 shape is translated on to another and that \nthey form the exact same angles and have the same segments;\nso parts of ~== shapes ~==",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-bkrOdOxmzxFtKqHXUjBC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4668.184114783704,
      "y": -2929.373752362799,
      "width": 548.0595703125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1619151232,
      "version": 366,
      "versionNonce": 853308287,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789750774783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "By assumption they are coplanor and because they are \ncongruent we are assuming that they have the same \ndirection (translated) properly then we can also deduce \nthat they dont intersect hecne\nthe two lines are parallel;\nbut this direction and translated properly \nis pretty vague ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "By assumption they are coplanor and because they are \ncongruent we are assuming that they have the same \ndirection (translated) properly then we can also deduce \nthat they dont intersect hecne\nthe two lines are parallel;\nbut this direction and translated properly \nis pretty vague ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "v3olDM01CATWw5-kCFlQA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4202.539278357923,
      "y": -3658.8794438911195,
      "width": 571.159423828125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 430147968,
      "version": 335,
      "versionNonce": 1307953137,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789750774783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so im thinking of a drawing app something like\n- u give it a shape ( MVP with triangles)\n- then it will clone itself 4 times (saving the 8 new points)\n- and then repeat itself over and over until some \nlimit or just add a canvas filled out checker!;",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "so im thinking of a drawing app something like\n- u give it a shape ( MVP with triangles)\n- then it will clone itself 4 times (saving the 8 new points)\n- and then repeat itself over and over until some \nlimit or just add a canvas filled out checker!;",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
